---
title: Potato Puffs
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Veggies
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@mashed potatoes{1%c}
@flour{1/2%c}
@baking powder{1.5%tsp}
@well beaten eggs{2}
@salt{1/4%tsp}
@salt{1%dash}

Mix dry ingredients. Mix potatoes and eggs well. Add dry ingredients and mix. Drop by tsp into deep fryer until golden brown.
